    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d966">

                <pb facs="0751" n="669" sameAs="frus:frus1911/pg669"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 817.00/1725.</note>
                <head>[Untitled]</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Managua</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1911-11-18"><hi rendition="#italic">November 18,
                        1911</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>I respectfully request instructions as to article 3 of agreement 1, signed
                    October 27, 1910, by Estrada and others, whether you wish me to point out again
                    the pledges therein. The present (second) National Constituent Assembly will
                    adjourn in a few days and has not called a presidential election under the
                    constitution.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Gunther.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
